1901–02 was [[Celtic F.C.|Celtic Football Club]]'s 14th season of competitive association football.  Celtic competed in the [[Scottish First Division]],<ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.londonhearts.com/scores/a1900/celtic1902.htm|title=Results for Celtic for 1901-02|website=www.londonhearts.com}}</ref> in which they ended runners-up for the third consecutive season. They also narrowly missed on Scottish Cup glory as they lost the final 0-1 to [[Hibernian F.C.|Hibernian]].

